title: Workspace: a third folder is put on the canvas, one taken off, one forgotten, all put back
folders: rust-small, plain
fixtures: git-history
expect-log: script: Workspace\("all"\)
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3500
left files
wait 600
mark two-folders
wait 500
workspace put {FIX}\git-history
wait 2500
mark three-folders
wait 500
workspace off {FIX}\plain
wait 1500
mark plain-off
wait 500
workspace forget {FIX}\rust-small
wait 1500
mark rust-small-forgotten
wait 500
workspace all
wait 2500
mark all-back
wait 500
folders
wait 700
mark switcher
wait 500
quit
